Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 23:22:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] browser page: Allow OAuth apps on Request VM
 (spec.oauthClients)

A field under Compute, one app per line (client_id, then scopes), maps to
the EphemeralInfra contract template's oauthClients, which the requester turns
into a com.fedproxy.rbac role the VM's workload identity uses to approve those
OAuth sign-ins as the signed-in account (socialweb-computer-kcp plan 0040,
docs/pds/oauth-wid.md). Needs an account on a socialweb-computer PDS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XtTWStqstmFZHUkRsRsthA
